  decision: `<p><b>Performance counters</b> on every unit and on the DRAM bus, a <b>JTAG</b> debug port, a small <b>trace buffer</b>, plus standard manufacturing test: <b>scan chains</b> and <b>memory self-test</b>. Temperature and voltage sensors, one-time fuses.</p>`,
  why: "The counters are how we measure utilization, our main design lever, and they are the RL compiler's reward signal. Test logic is needed for any credible tapeout.",
