  decision: `<p>Working assumption: <b>TSMC N6</b>, a die of about <b>80 mm²</b> (a guess until synthesis), flip-chip BGA package. Not decided: the node is driven by <b>which nodes have a licensable GDDR7 PHY</b>, by how much of our die actually shrinks, and by one-time costs.</p>`,
